  "description": "Introducing the Go Flow Electric Scooter, a blend of comfort, practicality, and performance. Built with a high-quality steel frame and adjustable-height stem, this scooter is perfect for daily commutes and leisurely rides. The Go Flow features a powerful 36V 350W hub motor that delivers a top speed of 16 mph and an impressive range of up to 18 miles on a single charge, making it a reliable choice for getting around town. The 12\" pneumatic tires by Chaoyang and front and rear mechanical disc brakes with a power-off function ensure a smooth and safe ride, while the IP54 waterproof rating provides durability in various weather conditions. This scooter also includes a front headlight for visibility, a rear basket for convenient storage, and a front display that shows speed, battery status, and mileage. Designed with a strong frame and a comfortable seat, the Go Flow is equipped to handle riders up to 265 lbs. Experience the freedom of easy transportation with the Go Flow Electric Scooter.\n\n16mphTop Speed\n\nUp to 18 miles Range\n\n350 WHub Motor\n\n36V7.8 Ah",
